'' Under -exx a constant subscript outside a fixed array's bounds is TKO0960 when it is a CONST
'' name or folds to one, as fbc's 92 is -- not only when it is a literal. See the source.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -exx --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/const-oob-folded.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: const-oob-folded.bas(7,8): error TKO0960: the subscript 5 is outside the array's bounds, 1 to 3
'' EXPECT-OUT: const-oob-folded.bas(8,8): error TKO0960: the subscript 4
'' EXPECT-OUT: const-oob-folded.bas(13,12): error TKO0960: the subscript 9 is outside the array's bounds, 0 to 1
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 3
